OL,3,GNEWSAEx-addict celebrates sobriety by  
OL,4,Aclimbing Kilimanjaro                   
OL,6,FFor Jon Cooper, every day clean and    
OL,7,Fsober is a "miracle", and now he wants 
OL,8,Fto give others the same experience.    
OL,10,FAfter a decade addicted to drugs and   
OL,11,Falcohol, Cooper, from Motcombe, Dorset,
OL,12,Fhas climbed Mount Kilimanjaro to raise 
OL,13,Fmoney for the Clouds House rehab centre
OL,14,Fin Wiltshire, which he credits with    
OL,15,Fsaving his life.                       
OL,17,FHe hopes the money will give someone   
OL,18,Felse more time in rehab, which he says 
OL,19,Fchanged everything for him.            
