OL,3,GNEWSAEx-addict celebrates sobriety by  
OL,4,Aclimbing Kilimanjaro                   
OL,6,F"Anyone who can get a placement at     
OL,7,FClouds House, their life can change for
OL,8,Fthe better and they can live a life    
OL,9,Fbeyond their wildest dreams," he said. 
